{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","噜噜冲锋"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一条直线上的敌人发起冲锋造成伤害并击退至终点。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择范围内一条直线方向上的一个地图格发起冲锋，将沿途目标击退至终点附近。冲锋结束后对邻格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并嘲讽其3秒。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":70,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":82,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","嘲讽时长提升至4秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","图腾护佑"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自身添加护盾，附近敌人数量越多护盾值越高。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","图腾柱的力量为自身添加抵御450% + 40% ATK伤害的护盾持续12秒，并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升30%。同时为身边最近的2名友军提升30%的护甲，持续7秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升35%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升40%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升45%。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","战争践踏"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","踩踏地面造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","噜噜踩踏地面，对附近1格范围内的敌人造成240% ATK伤害和1 + 0.25秒眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每命中一名敌人，减少本技能1秒剩余冷却时间。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，当相邻敌人较多时进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高9点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升10点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","撼地怒击"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每累计受到一定伤害会发起一次暴怒攻击对不同范围内的敌人造成伤害并降低攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每累计受到40%最大生命值的伤害时，使用图腾连续砸地3次，依次对自身周围1格、2格、3格范围内的敌人造成150% ATK伤害，并降低其25%攻击力持续6秒，最后一击还会将敌人击飞。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":98,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始以及首个友军被击败时，可额外使用一次该技能。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至210% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“图腾护佑”中的护盾存在时，每秒回复生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“图腾护佑”中的护盾存在时，自身每秒回复7% HP的生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","首次释放“撼地怒击”时，自身获得500% ATK“图腾护佑”的护盾，并使“战争践踏”获得永久强化，造成的眩晕时间增加1秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","大地之怒"]]}